      "name": "Rosh R Nair",
      "created_at": "2022-08-13T03:51:59.514Z",
      "cooked": "<p>GST rate and tax amount not auto-calculating. The respective tax items are getting populated in the tax field on selecting an item/customer.</p>\n<p>For own state customer CGST and SGST is showing up. For other state customer IGST is showing up. But tax rate and values are not getting populated.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/2/92a6876c472f54852bc7edc5c37718725b2eec02.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/92a6876c472f54852bc7edc5c37718725b2eec02\" title=\"GST values not populating\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/92a6876c472f54852bc7edc5c37718725b2eec02_2_690x302.png\" alt=\"GST values not populating\" data-base62-sha1=\"kVkuQ3EHdneUPAgHN0MLPZUtaYq\" width=\"690\" height=\"302\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/92a6876c472f54852bc7edc5c37718725b2eec02_2_690x302.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/92a6876c472f54852bc7edc5c37718725b2eec02_2_1035x453.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/2/92a6876c472f54852bc7edc5c37718725b2eec02.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFB\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">GST values not populating</span><span class=\"informations\">1064×467 32.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
