      "created_at": "2022-08-13T06:25:01.452Z",
      "cooked": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Where have you set your tax rates? Can you share screenshot?<br>\nAccounting → Item Tax Template<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/0/20c812e0ee31e2a63057ba50f1ce714b89c6cafe.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/20c812e0ee31e2a63057ba50f1ce714b89c6cafe\" title=\"GST Rate Setting\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/0/20c812e0ee31e2a63057ba50f1ce714b89c6cafe_2_690x287.png\" alt=\"GST Rate Setting\" data-base62-sha1=\"4FZVYqDX6kHhmUtcxebyZryR3j0\" width=\"690\" height=\"287\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/0/20c812e0ee31e2a63057ba50f1ce714b89c6cafe_2_690x287.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/0/20c812e0ee31e2a63057ba50f1ce714b89c6cafe.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/0/20c812e0ee31e2a63057ba50f1ce714b89c6cafe.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFDFD\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">GST Rate Setting</span><span class=\"informations\">1023×426 19.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>What are the tax rates setup in your default tax templates.<br>\n5%, 12%, 18% and 28% with CGST,SGST and IGST Splits</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If tax rates are set in Item Tax Template, Is you Item Tax Template set in Item Master?<br>\nYes, It has been associated with the item.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If taxes are set in Item Tax Template and is set in Item Master, is it getting fetch in the Sales Invoice here? Share the screenshot of the Item Details with Item tax template getting loaded.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/2/9285ddbfd1d1e456027e54132586b94e0f30bcd9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9285ddbfd1d1e456027e54132586b94e0f30bcd9\" title=\"salesinvoice_itemlist1\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/9285ddbfd1d1e456027e54132586b94e0f30bcd9_2_690x234.png\" alt=\"salesinvoice_itemlist1\" data-base62-sha1=\"kUcw65HV2lZVdGDHGpz8Mo1ojGh\" width=\"690\" height=\"234\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/9285ddbfd1d1e456027e54132586b94e0f30bcd9_2_690x234.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/9285ddbfd1d1e456027e54132586b94e0f30bcd9_2_1035x351.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/2/9285ddbfd1d1e456027e54132586b94e0f30bcd9.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">salesinvoice_itemlist1</span><span class=\"informations\">1068×363 20.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/0/50ac6c70da31f8d7542b6765533e97957181d22e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/50ac6c70da31f8d7542b6765533e97957181d22e\" title=\"salesinvoice_itemlist2\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/50ac6c70da31f8d7542b6765533e97957181d22e_2_690x362.png\" alt=\"salesinvoice_itemlist2\" data-base62-sha1=\"bvFC2fxRsswp4BgdeseiJS7WoMe\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/50ac6c70da31f8d7542b6765533e97957181d22e_2_690x362.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/50ac6c70da31f8d7542b6765533e97957181d22e_2_103