      "id": 334340,
      "username": "roshrnair",
      "name": "Rosh R Nair",
      "created_at": "2022-08-13T08:39:26.821Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ahh… Yes, If I update the item tax template here, the tax value is appearing. But the problem is non of my existing tax templates are listed here neither the one that has been already assigned to the item. So had to try by creating a new item tax template from the option “Create a new item tax template”.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/0/008dc9ace06f8c3b8155c801dc9551799300607b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/008dc9ace06f8c3b8155c801dc9551799300607b\" title=\"Edit sales invoice line\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/0/008dc9ace06f8c3b8155c801dc9551799300607b_2_690x457.png\" alt=\"Edit sales invoice line\" data-base62-sha1=\"4TMih6kJPsvJP4fzxr8N54KsHN\" width=\"690\" height=\"457\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/0/008dc9ace06f8c3b8155c801dc9551799300607b_2_690x457.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/0/008dc9ace06f8c3b8155c801dc9551799300607b.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/0/008dc9ace06f8c3b8155c801dc9551799300607b.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAFA\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Edit sales invoice line</span><span class=\"informations\">933×619 44.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Why is the assigned item tax template not appearing here?</p>",
