      "created_at": "2022-08-13T13:40:22.935Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Updating the item category column either at Item Group Level or Item level seems to be solving the issue. The system is auto-fetching the rates and calculating the gst amount correctly. But, is this this the right method? I haven’t seen this method in any of the documents or training videos.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/3/230388f8c3d8e18e1a7abcfd79a70c632bbe1a6b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/230388f8c3d8e18e1a7abcfd79a70c632bbe1a6b\" title=\"item_group_tax_with_item_category\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/3/230388f8c3d8e18e1a7abcfd79a70c632bbe1a6b_2_690x194.png\" alt=\"item_group_tax_with_item_category\" data-base62-sha1=\"4ZKhGz03lxmKtIUQeLLRm2bMelJ\" width=\"690\" height=\"194\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/3/230388f8c3d8e18e1a7abcfd79a70c632bbe1a6b_2_690x194.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/3/230388f8c3d8e18e1a7abcfd79a70c632bbe1a6b_2_1035x291.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/3/230388f8c3d8e18e1a7abcfd79a70c632bbe1a6b.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFB\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">item_group_tax_with_item_category</span><span class=\"informations\">1247×351 31.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
